WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:03.220
Knee braces. When do they actually help?

00:03.720 --> 00:13.140
A brace can help when your knee feels weak or unsteady, for long walks, travel or sport. A soft sleeve can also feel warm and supportive.

00:13.640 --> 00:19.030
But a brace doesn't fix the cause of the pain. It supports the knee while you get stronger.

00:19.530 --> 00:26.570
Don't wear it all day, every day. Your thigh muscles can get lazy and weaker. Keep doing your knee exercises.

00:27.070 --> 00:37.180
It should be snug, not tight. Take it off if your leg tingles, goes numb or swells, and ask your physio or doctor which brace is right for you.
